# DigitalGuardian area 53, the forcing run (digitalguardian_force.py): "OPEN" twice 100 updates
# apart (the second finds the beacon up, 0x1268 == 1, and is skipped: fn_14_A6A8's cmpwi at
# 0xAA4C), then the scan display, whose fn_14_9ABC calls get 0x11EC (the beacon model) emptied
# and then 0x128C bit 0x08 set by gdb.
@f30 layer 3
@f60 layer 11
@f140 send e00350060 Activate; send e0035000f Activate
@f160 send e00350060 0x4F50454E
@f260 send e00350060 0x4F50454E
@f300 scan e00350060
@f360 scan e00350060
@f420 scan
@f620 scan
@f700 covdump
